<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Yes, good point, I was thinking of e.g. &lt;c&gt;if&lt;/c&gt; and &lt;c&gt;for&lt;/c&gt;, but I didn't list &lt;c&gt;goto&lt;/c&gt; but did list &lt;c&gt;return&lt;/c&gt; - now that I think about it some more, I probably shouldn't have listed the latter because it can't really be approximated by a &lt;c&gt;sub&lt;/c&gt; (that's how I personally generally differentiate between "functions" and "operators" in Perl, but this isn't perfect and a pretty big grey area).
&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
